# Vessel IV-N — scrub T2 basic tank (Color factory escapee)

[title Vessel IV-N]
[image monsters/scrub_giant.png]
[blood #6b3aa0]
[stats hp=24]

* move Attack
  narration: It brings a blocky limb down at you, plates still hissing.
  narration: A blocky limb sweeps across — slower than it ought to be, heavier than it has any right to be.

* move Defend
  narration: The vents close one by one. The plates seal flush.

* move Recover
  narration: The Color cycles inside the gray plates, and what was venting goes back where it came from.

* move Heavy Power Defend
  narration: Every vent on the unit shuts at once and the Color folds back inward, sealing it behind itself.

* move Heavy Power Recover
  narration: The plates seal hot. The Color rolls back into the vents and the unit takes whatever it gives back from inside.

* intro
You smell it first — hot metal and something sweeter, like fruit gone
wrong. The thing comes around the rail-cut on three legs and one limb
that is not quite a leg, taller than a guardhouse, plated in Kesharat
industrial gray. The Color leaks from a vent on its side in pulses you
cannot quite see directly. A small man in administrator's whites is
jogging behind it with a tablet, shouting calmly: "Stand clear of the
unit. Stand clear of the unit." The unit does not stand clear of you.

* win
+give_gold 12
+add_tag killed_vessel_iv_n
The vents close one by one. The Color seals itself back behind the gray
plates and the unit settles where it stands. The administrator is
nowhere in sight. Far up the rail-cut, a tablet is bleating an alert
nobody is listening to.

* lose
The Color discharges in a sweep that takes the road and you with it.
Far up the rail-cut, a tablet is still bleating its alert.
